// Timing: the shared divider. Each divide takes 10 cycles and the two
// share one unit: the first runs in cycles 3-12, the second waits for
// it and runs in 13-22. The $halt leaves EXEC behind it (cycle 23) and
// WRITEBACK in cycle 25: 26 cycles.
//
//@ cycles: 26
//@ reg: 0 $r1 7
//@ expect: 0 reg $r2 0x1
//@ expect: 0 reg $r3 0x1
    || / $r2 ($i64) $r1 $r1 ;
    || / $r3 ($i64) $r1 $r1 ;
    || $halt ;
